                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c2df6289-b53d-33b9-9ad9-5143300d53f8",
                        "entry_id": "7e2b9627-c5ed-364b-b63c-7cb16a7923b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "tradycyjna zbiorowa zabawa taneczna, o XIX-wiecznym francuskim rodowodzie, złożona z kilku samodzielnych tańców i zabaw, niekiedy z wymianą drobnych upominków, podczas której tańczy się walca figurowego, mazurka albo galop, a w której pary dobierają się według przypiętych wcześniej wstążek kotylionów (2.1)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "72e3eda5-d949-4181-a8bc-d7b7e31e3c02",
                                "sense_id": "c2df6289-b53d-33b9-9ad9-5143300d53f8",
                                "text": "Jako jeden z bohaterów dzisiejszego dnia i prywatny detektyw incognito, zrozumiałem, że będę musiał odważyć się na słynny kotylion, a może także na kilka suwanych i skakanych."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2912250f-047a-4829-9508-194602cfa940",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e2b9627-c5ed-364b-b63c-7cb16a7923b5",
                        "source_sense_id": "c2df6289-b53d-33b9-9ad9-5143300d53f8",
                        "target_lang_word": "cotillion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cotillion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a4c4a46-860e-37f5-bef3-a77de35d507c",
                                        "entry_id": "ba7dc438-2e9a-3a2f-9885-96de1251b373",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bold dance performed in groups of eight where women lift their skirts to display their ankles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f71350f-2e02-46eb-ac2d-4cf2127d61a4",
                                                "sense_id": "9a4c4a46-860e-37f5-bef3-a77de35d507c",
                                                "text": "Mrs. Hughes now joined them, and asked Miss Tilney if she was ready to go. \"I hope I shall have the pleasure of seeing you again soon,\" said Catherine. \"Shall you be at the cotillion ball tomorrow?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea655075-edae-4a35-88c5-173a92655f51",
                                                "sense_id": "9a4c4a46-860e-37f5-bef3-a77de35d507c",
                                                "text": "The second figure [of the dance] commenced, and I made a sad bungle; so I did of the third, and fourth, and fifth, for I never had danced a cotillon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26c7375c-c3a9-3118-9eed-7c81a2d468fa",
                                        "entry_id": "ba7dc438-2e9a-3a2f-9885-96de1251b373",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The music regulating the cotillion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f6f3613-3e6c-4fc5-803a-dce00fe4676c",
                                                "sense_id": "26c7375c-c3a9-3118-9eed-7c81a2d468fa",
                                                "text": "1848 I kept a parlor open for the reception of visitors, many came here to practise with me, and many more to listen to us—several young men put themselves under my tuition, and although I had never been taught myself, they progressed finely in their studies and I soon brought out, not only the best field music, but also for dinners, balls, cotilion and tea parties, weddings, &c. THRILLING SKETCH OF THE LIFE OF THE DISTINGUISHED CHIEF OKAH TUBBEE ALIAS, WM. CHUBBEE, Son of the Head Chief, Mosholeh Tubbee, of theChoctaw Nation of Indians. BY REV. L. L. ALLEN, AUTHOR OF “PENCILLINGS UPON THE RIO GRANDE,” &c. NEW YORK, 1848. ENTERED according to the Act of Congress, in the year 1848, by Okah Tubbee, alias William Chubbee, in the Clerk's Office of the District Court of the United States, for the Southern District of New York. AN ESSAY UPON THE INDIAN CHARACTER.http://docsouth.unc.edu/neh/tubbee1848/tubbee1848.xml"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a33868d2-8e25-3dd2-9260-4168301f5036",
                                        "entry_id": "ba7dc438-2e9a-3a2f-9885-96de1251b373",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of cotillion ball, a coming-of-age party meant to present girls newly transitioned into womanhood to the community for courtship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "ellipsis"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffff75fc-f9df-48e3-a5fd-9e9677c00960",
                                                "sense_id": "a33868d2-8e25-3dd2-9260-4168301f5036",
                                                "text": "\"Well,\" I answered, at first with uncertainty, then with inspiration, \"he would do splendidly to lead your cotillon, if you think of having one.\" / \"So you do not dance, Mr. Crocker?\" / I was somewhat set back by her perspicuity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c3c2c9a-0764-404a-8d12-f794877b08b3",
                                                "sense_id": "a33868d2-8e25-3dd2-9260-4168301f5036",
                                                "text": "But now, WASP's want their place in the multicultural sun. Social rituals are social rituals. If there is Kwanzaa, why not cotillions?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "814678e4-be01-4949-9dd2-daab97a7a5a9",
                                                "sense_id": "a33868d2-8e25-3dd2-9260-4168301f5036",
                                                "text": "At a desk outside the [Bernsteins’] door … I said, ‘Tom Wolfe,’ and sure enough, there he was, Tom Wolfe, listed on a yellow legal pad … Like any boy who has been instructed at cotillion to pay his respects to the host and hostess first … I sought out Leonard and Felicia Bernstein and introduced myself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b767c081-845a-311c-b816-43af69c5b633",
                                        "entry_id": "ba7dc438-2e9a-3a2f-9885-96de1251b373",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kind of woollen material for women's skirts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cotillion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4bffa04c-be80-3ce3-903a-5077c7e62392",
                                        "entry_id": "f5437401-5238-3295-8b1e-d59e80ee3bd5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To dance the cotillion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb4faaed-27ec-4473-9e1e-f85d956c30b6",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e2b9627-c5ed-364b-b63c-7cb16a7923b5",
                        "source_sense_id": "c2df6289-b53d-33b9-9ad9-5143300d53f8",
                        "target_lang_word": "cotillon",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cotillon",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c0711b1-0894-3aa0-9e18-123df118544f",
                                        "entry_id": "314327af-7ed3-30da-9903-7d2a04acb162",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cotte ou jupe de dessous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b88f35d-01cf-4cc2-85d1-c3e2104c34a0",
                                                "sense_id": "8c0711b1-0894-3aa0-9e18-123df118544f",
                                                "text": "Ma femme a trente-six cotillons et j’ai même pas une culotte !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1142e25-58c5-381c-930d-2ef7c72f159e",
                                        "entry_id": "314327af-7ed3-30da-9903-7d2a04acb162",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jupon des femmes du peuple et des paysannes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6ff91ac-cd1c-4b24-8c5e-2b70843c1c6d",
                                                "sense_id": "a1142e25-58c5-381c-930d-2ef7c72f159e",
                                                "text": "Une fille passa, conduisant un troupeau de dindons ; elle était vêtue d’un cotillon ignoble, et elle était sans beauté."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83c18423-1ba5-4268-97a5-020385e26092",
                                                "sense_id": "a1142e25-58c5-381c-930d-2ef7c72f159e",
                                                "text": "Puis pivotant dans son ample cotillon, qui fit une gracieuse corolle autour de ses chevilles, elle voleta d'un pas léger vers la cuisine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05745270-dcbc-3b0e-9954-7841c660efd5",
                                        "entry_id": "314327af-7ed3-30da-9903-7d2a04acb162",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Femme, dans un jeu de séduction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73434b72-61d2-431f-9f49-456db0595b82",
                                                "sense_id": "05745270-dcbc-3b0e-9954-7841c660efd5",
                                                "text": "FRANÇOISE : […]. Et ça vous enrage de voir de braves garçons se troubler la cervelle pour le premier cotillon venu !\nPIERRE : Le premier cotillon venu ! Dites une femme comme il n'y en a pas deux, une femme...\nFRANÇOISE, vivement : Ah ! t'es amoureux ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82b0f0ae-4369-3e17-8082-ecff368d07d1",
                                        "entry_id": "314327af-7ed3-30da-9903-7d2a04acb162",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Danse avec figures variées qui terminait certains bals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c04671f4-3cac-40f0-b40d-c93398a14dab",
                                                "sense_id": "82b0f0ae-4369-3e17-8082-ecff368d07d1",
                                                "text": "Ces danseurs et ces danseuses, presque étrangers à la maison, et qui finissent par s’emparer du terrain à toutes les noces, se livraient à ces interminables dernières contredanses nommées des cotillons, les joueurs de bouillotte étaient acharnés à leurs tables, le père Crevel gagnait six mille francs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd9379f5-4c47-4828-badb-b42523eedef9",
                                                "sense_id": "82b0f0ae-4369-3e17-8082-ecff368d07d1",
                                                "text": "Vers une heure du matin, entrait avec bruit le petit groupe de la jeunesse dorée bruxelloise, décidé à ne s’amuser et à ne danser le cotillon qu’entre soi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8f08de8-b2c2-427b-bba4-86077f435699",
                                                "sense_id": "82b0f0ae-4369-3e17-8082-ecff368d07d1",
                                                "text": "Lensky a tout vu, il s’indigne, il ne peut plus se contenir, et, après la mazourka, il invite sa fiancée pour le cotillon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ec1c36e-ed66-31fa-8824-003f00149c7a",
                                        "entry_id": "314327af-7ed3-30da-9903-7d2a04acb162",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accessoire de fête en papier ou carton."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e45a6d10-530b-44b6-a255-d4267f279820",
                                                "sense_id": "2ec1c36e-ed66-31fa-8824-003f00149c7a",
                                                "text": "Elle sortit du sac un sans-gêne — ce cotillon qui se déroule comme une langue en produisant un drôle de bruit. Elle souffla dedans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4e68132-67ac-4630-9501-116ff6d59308",
                                                "sense_id": "2ec1c36e-ed66-31fa-8824-003f00149c7a",
                                                "text": "J'étais bien seul, pour la première fois, sans enfants de mon âge autour de moi avec langues de belle-mère et cotillons comme ce fut le cas l'année précédente sur la terrasse de l'appartement du 22 Boulevard de Marseille."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80b1058a-1394-4b16-a98b-79af26e391ae",
                                                "sense_id": "2ec1c36e-ed66-31fa-8824-003f00149c7a",
                                                "text": "Elle est fiancée à un des plus riches héritiers du Marais. Le fils d’un fabricant de farces-attrapes et d’accessoires de cotillon…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
